drm/msm: Gate recovery work during final DRM teardown

Serialize every recovery enqueue with terminal closure; then cancel
pending work and wait for a running callback before touching runtime
PM or dismantling GMU resources. Ordinary sleep never closes the gate.

This is not a terminal DMA stop: a stuck job can still make the later
suspend attempt time out. Keep the candidate build-only.

